<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.mooniex.org-snapshot</string>

  <!-- Org Mesh W1.7 (docs/design/org-mesh.md, docs/design/tasks-db-hub.md):
       refreshes state/tasks.snapshot.db from the Postgres hub every 900s so
       lib.db.get_conn() has a read-only fallback when ORG_DB_URL is set but
       the hub can't be reached. One-shot script, not a --loop daemon like
       com.mooniex.agents-watchdog.plist -- StartInterval instead of
       RunAtLoad+KeepAlive. Install (on the Mac, the spoke that needs a local
       fallback if the Contabo hub goes down):
         cp scripts/com.mooniex.org-snapshot.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
         launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.mooniex.org-snapshot.plist
       No-op (exit 0, "hub not configured") on a box where the wrapper finds
       no ORG_DB_URL -- safe to install everywhere.

       ORG_DB_URL comes from scripts/hub/with-org-db-env.sh, named here in
       the template itself: the wrapper reads the hub env file (or this
       host's Infisical identity) at run time, so no value lands in this
       file, and on a host with neither it is a plain exec. Installed on the
       Mac 2026-10-02 after the G1 cutover shipped without it. -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/gob/MoonieXHQ/Agents/Core/scripts/hub/with-org-db-env.sh</string>
    <string>/Users/gob/MoonieXHQ/Agents/Core/.venv/bin/python</string>
    <string>/Users/gob/MoonieXHQ/Agents/Core/scripts/hub/export_to_sqlite.py</string>
  </array>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
  </dict>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/gob/MoonieXHQ/Agents/Core</string>

  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>900</integer>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/gob/MoonieXHQ/Agents/Core/state/org-snapshot.log</string>

  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/gob/MoonieXHQ/Agents/Core/state/org-snapshot.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
